26 0 obj
<</Author(Motorola Solutions)/CreationDate(D:20160309083322-05'00')/Creator(Adobe InDesign CS6 \(Windows\))/Keywords(WAVE; WAVE Work Group Communications; advanced desktop communicator; WAVE dispatch; dispatch; push-to-talk; PTT)/ModDate(D:20160309083326-05'00')/Producer(Adobe PDF Library 10.0.1)/Subject(The WAVE Advanced Desktop Communicator is a powerful software application designed to provide many of the capabilities associated with dispatch consoles deployed for mission-critical public safety, military and critical infrastructure organizations. Using\
 a laptop computer and a microphone-equipped headset, an Advanced Desktop Communicator lets the operator create and manage a large number of communications channels, create and tear down patches between channels, manage user access to Channels, access rad\
io alarms and use radio IDs to identify individual radios and users.)/Title(WAVE Advanced Desktop Communicator Data Sheet)/Trapped/false>>
endobj
